  "solution": {
    "text": "The equation of a line passing through <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and perpendicular to <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> is<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />or, <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />The coordinates of the point of intersection of <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are <math><mi>E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />The line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> meets <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Now,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
